{"channelId":"UC_jhPGU5bczAwhX9DYEX76A","row":["Kathleen Lisson",16200,"How to recover from facelift, breast augmentation, tummy tuck and liposuction surgery.\n\nHi, I'm Kathleen Helen Lisson. My videos provide tips on reducing swelling after plastic surgery. I am a lymphedema therapist and NCBTMB Board Certified Massage therapist. I am the author of Facelift Recovery Handbook, Plastic Surgery Recovery Handbook and Lipedema Treatment Guide. I provide manual lymphatic drainage for post-surgical swelling and fibrosis as well as longevity massage in San Diego. I also teach Plastic Surgery Recovery and Fibrosis Massage classes for CEU credit.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_jhPGU5bczAwhX9DYEX76A","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_jhPGU5bczAwhX9DYEX76A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:29.642Z","channelId":"UC_jhPGU5bczAwhX9DYEX76A","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"fb6792c1b14dc2f8678cd95c77425b4a5d212f51b01578c02def5bb3dc4c8e14","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"17ee9cd86f021ba623c6fb9f5e6ed89160b8a19e7f6256127db04d9a7d649db4"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_jhPGU5bczAwhX9DYEX76A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:29.642Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_jhPGU5bczAwhX9DYEX76A","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":16200,"raw":"16.2K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_jhPGU5bczAwhX9DYEX76A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:29.642Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.amazon.com/shop/profile/amzn1.account.AGCKPIKGF37MQ7NG27IUVITNNCLQ/list/3V52UWRZQFU9D?ref=cm_sw_r_cp_ud_aipsflist_WWRY1D0X23YVFMYW0YY0&ref_=cm_sw_r_cp_ud_aipsflist_WWRY1D0X23YVFMYW0YY0&social_share=cm_sw_r_cp_ud_aipsflist_WWRY1D0X23YVFMYW0YY0","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:21:57.172Z"}],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["massage the